Summary::md .summary
  When using the demo as a standalone mapping tool, the chat is mostly annoying
  (although it could be useful for procedurally generating rooms). There should
  be an option to hide it.

  But we have to do this intelligently, as we need to keep the options buttons
  at the top still alive. But we want the canvas to fill where the chat
  would’ve been. so the options buttons need to sit on top of the canvas when
  the chat is hidden.

Resolved Jul 07, 2022, 07:19PM::md .update
  Done!
